locked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm running into issues with a Next.js version 9.1.3 and now 16.4.4 where everything will deploy and work but I get a number of 404 errors for my apis and dynamic routes.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"678\" alt=\"Nextjs dynamic routing error\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1043257/68629464-9db39e80-04a9-11ea-8a01-2191d29ca28b.png\">\r\n \r\nMy now.json only has my environmental variables because I read that the latest versions of Next.js and Now do not need any sort of configuration. Is there something I am missing?  Here is my folder structure:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"145\" alt=\"Folder structure\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1043257/68630381-cbe6ad80-04ac-11ea-8322-2b8d39795d98.png\">\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/3294/reactions","total_count":34,"+1":34,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/3294/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/14242","id":3614552718,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBAnUbs6y4FmI","number":14242,"title":"[ruby] ruby on rails","user":{"login":"ricardo-agz","id":30984749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTg0NzQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30984749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz","html_url":"https://github.com/ricardo-agz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ricardo-agz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-11-12T01:58:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T15:35:05Z","closed_at":"2026-09-09T15:35:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/pulls/14242","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/14242","diff_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/14242.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/14242.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds Ruby on Rails as a supported framework preset (flagged as experimental)\r\n\r\nAdds a Rails example to /examples\r\nhttps://vercel-plus-rails.vercel.app/\r\n\r\nUpdates Ruby builder to return `BuilResultVX` like the Python builder does:\r\n* Regular Ruby builds return v3\r\n* Rails returns v2","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/14242/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/13799","id":3339158289,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBAnUbs6kjV2K","number":13799,"title":"feat(next): add clientParamParsingOrigins support for external rewrite headers","user":{"login":"wyattjoh","id":633002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzAwMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/633002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattjoh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattjoh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-20T18:36:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T13:27:12Z","closed_at":"2025-08-20T19:53:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/pulls/13799","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/13799","diff_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/13799.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel/pull/13799.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-20T19:53:02Z"},"body":"This change introduces a new experimental configuration option `clientParamParsingOrigins` that allows controlling which external origins can receive rewrite headers during client parameter parsing. Previously, all external rewrites were blocked from receiving these headers for security reasons.\r\n\r\nThe implementation adds origin extraction logic and regex-based matching against the configured allowed origins list, enabling secure cross-origin rewrite header forwarding for trusted domains while maintaining security for untrusted external destinations.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel/issues/13799/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}